{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trapped in what seems to be an endless hospital department. Carefully observe your surroundings in each loop to escape the Liminal Department</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Phenomenon Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an ever-changing hallway filled with unusual occurrences. Each loop could have multiple anomalies or none. Some are easy to spot, others are not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/GIF_Anomaly.gif?t=1745382050\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Submit for Anomalies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After a careful\u00a0examination submit for anomalies to proceed further. Memory skills are key to breaking the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/GIF_Screen.gif?t=1745382050\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trapped In a Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caught in a never-ending loop, leaving the department only leads you right back into the same hallway.\u00a0Reach department 13 to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412000/extras/GIF_ExitNumbers.gif?t=1745382050\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic and eerie experience with minimal UI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 60 anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Camera bobbing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Break The Loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3412000/45edfbe2d3732615cd87c08601a5c10881bf12ba.jpg"},{"name":"Advanced Observer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstat